{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00067",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 5.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Doctor? Hi. I hope I've got the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.61,
      "end_seconds": 9.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.22,
      "end_seconds": 17.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Um, thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.43,
      "end_seconds": 21.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 21.91,
      "end_seconds": 25.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "He's been having burning when I pass urine, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.4,
      "end_seconds": 31.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "How long have you had it? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.82,
      "end_seconds": 40.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "Yeah, about... well, two days. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.04,
      "end_seconds": 44.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Does it happen all the time or in spells?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.51,
      "end_seconds": 47.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "It happens on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.36,
      "end_seconds": 54.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 54.26,
      "end_seconds": 60.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, you know, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.83,
      "end_seconds": 69.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.24,
      "text": "Okay, so I was getting to that! And an urgent need to pass urine as well, um, since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.67,
      "end_seconds": 72.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.37,
      "end_seconds": 83.33,
      "duration_seconds": 9.96,
      "text": "Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. Uh, and I've been needing to go all the time as well, for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.47,
      "end_seconds": 88.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Any similar episode recently, back pain, vaginal discharge or blood in the urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.24,
      "end_seconds": 104.65,
      "duration_seconds": 15.41,
      "text": "I mean, no, no similar episode recently, no back pain, no vaginal discharge. I did have pain low in the tummy at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.94,
      "end_seconds": 106.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.78,
      "text": "Any vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.6,
      "end_seconds": 109.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Not at all, no vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 110.22,
      "end_seconds": 115.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Well, actually, doctor, I did notice vomiting. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.43,
      "end_seconds": 122.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Hmm, no, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.78,
      "end_seconds": 129.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.83,
      "end_seconds": 133.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Uh, no, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.5,
      "end_seconds": 138.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.32,
      "end_seconds": 142.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Yeah, nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.38,
      "end_seconds": 144.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.91,
      "end_seconds": 149.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.02,
      "end_seconds": 150.8,
      "duration_seconds": 0.78,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.24,
      "end_seconds": 154.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.14,
      "end_seconds": 159.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.25,
      "end_seconds": 169.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.27,
      "end_seconds": 177.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Alright, what about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.14,
      "end_seconds": 192.13,
      "duration_seconds": 11.99,
      "text": "Diabetes, for nearly five years. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.6,
      "end_seconds": 196.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Mm-hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.55,
      "end_seconds": 206.86,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Well, um, I've had arthritis in my knees, yes. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.5,
      "end_seconds": 212.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Right, what about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.64,
      "end_seconds": 217.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "My mother has diabetes. Uh, my uncle had colon cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.06,
      "end_seconds": 220.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.65,
      "end_seconds": 224.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Okay, you know, so no, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.13,
      "end_seconds": 228.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.51,
      "end_seconds": 235.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 236.52,
      "end_seconds": 245.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.78,
      "text": "I mean, doctor, I think the last prescription for the diclofenac was 100 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.32,
      "end_seconds": 252.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.96,
      "end_seconds": 259.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "No, I left it at home. Cranberry juice. I take it every day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.79,
      "end_seconds": 272.69,
      "duration_seconds": 12.9,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.76,
      "end_seconds": 278.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Right, um, good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.39,
      "end_seconds": 283.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.7,
      "end_seconds": 293.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.62,
      "end_seconds": 315.94,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.8, respiratory rate 15. And pulse 82, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, blood pressure 114 over 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.81,
      "end_seconds": 320.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.1,
      "end_seconds": 321.8,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.69,
      "end_seconds": 325.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Right, look straight ahead for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.32,
      "end_seconds": 338.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "There's mild tenderness above the pubic bone, and no tenderness in the loins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.96,
      "end_seconds": 339.66,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.74,
      "end_seconds": 368.28,
      "duration_seconds": 25.54,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Putting it all together, this looks most like a urinary tract infection. It could also be a kidney infection, so we'll keep that open. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had burning when you pass urine for two days, and no similar episode recently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.18,
      "end_seconds": 370.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.38,
      "end_seconds": 373.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.12,
      "end_seconds": 378.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "I mean, um, of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.23,
      "end_seconds": 393.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. I'd like to arrange a urine test for urinary symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 394.12,
      "end_seconds": 397.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "I can book that for Thursday at 11:30 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 398.25,
      "end_seconds": 400.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Thursday, that works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.77,
      "end_seconds": 429.75,
      "duration_seconds": 26.98,
      "text": "Let's get a urine culture, for urinary symptoms. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'm prescribing nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, for five days. It's for urine infection. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Drink plenty of water and don't hold it in when you need to go. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 430.22,
      "end_seconds": 437.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 438.29,
      "end_seconds": 440.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Okay, uh, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 442.23,
      "end_seconds": 449.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "If you get a fever, back pain or vomiting, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 451.26,
      "end_seconds": 452.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 454.14,
      "end_seconds": 456.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 457.25,
      "end_seconds": 461.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Uh, sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 463.42,
      "end_seconds": 470.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 471.24,
      "end_seconds": 480.64,
      "duration_seconds": 9.4,
      "text": "So, I take the nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day and come back in a week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 481.07,
      "end_seconds": 486.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 487.65,
      "end_seconds": 492.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Right, I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 492.45,
      "end_seconds": 494.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}